{"3651550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunset Suckerpunch", "steam_appid": 3651550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Rider, explore Cadenza — a <strong>stylized,  synthwave cityscape</strong> — and fight to escape its limits alongside <strong>K8E</strong>: a mysterious persona-sword belonging to the oppressive Camerata. Tear across highway roads with her bike form, and leap into battle with her sword form. The Camerata stole your voice, and now they're coming after hers - fight for your freedom, and to take back what is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/250d0b93ebb5af476d656b7cfc21ef03.avif?t=1781737916\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras_big/250d0b93ebb5af476d656b7cfc21ef03.avif?t=1781737916 width=800 height=135 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your best weapon is the bodies of those who stand against you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=778 height=230 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dunk</strong> your enemies: turn them into <strong>projectiles</strong>, launching them at one another in <strong>stylish</strong> and <strong>spectacular</strong> combat. You're an unstoppable force of sword and fist, healing for every enemy defeated. Use everything at your disposal: dunk cars, explosives, anti-gravity-orbs, barrels, dumpsters, and many more ridiculous objects at your foes. Leave a trail of destruction and fractured asphalt as you carve a path through the hordes to silence <strong>five unique bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Camerata will increase their security with every boss that you and K8E silence, but it won't matter; together, <strong>you've got this</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/b72047dff38d3d6d09fe95cf53f16fb3.avif?t=1781737916\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras_big/b72047dff38d3d6d09fe95cf53f16fb3.avif?t=1781737916 width=800 height=135 /></span>Drive, drift, jump, and boost on a <strong>nimble and responsive</strong> physics-based <strong>motorcycle</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=247 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>stylized</strong>, <strong>vibrant</strong> <strong>regions</strong> and <strong>city districts</strong>. Discover new shortcuts and create new routes, alternating between K8E's gauntlet and bike form to chain together movement abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter packs of enemies on the road, and morph K8E into sword form; as the dust settles, morph her back into bike form and set off towards your next target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat with K8E</strong> in-between combat encounters. Get to know your mysterious vehicle-companion, and learn the circumstances of both her capture and betrayal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-tripping dunking system: launch cars, explosives, and dudes at other dudes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a friendship with K8E the talking, transforming motorcycle-gauntlet-sword</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive, fluid, physics-based motorcycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics for both K8E and the Rider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 80's synthwave retro-futuristic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic synthwave soundscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=778 height=233 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Rider, explore Cadenza — a <strong>stylized,  synthwave cityscape</strong> — and fight to escape its limits alongside <strong>K8E</strong>: a mysterious persona-sword belonging to the oppressive Camerata. Tear across highway roads with her bike form, and leap into battle with her sword form. The Camerata stole your voice, and now they're coming after hers - fight for your freedom, and to take back what is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/250d0b93ebb5af476d656b7cfc21ef03.avif?t=1781737916\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras_big/250d0b93ebb5af476d656b7cfc21ef03.avif?t=1781737916 width=800 height=135 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your best weapon is the bodies of those who stand against you.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=778 height=230 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dunk</strong> your enemies: turn them into <strong>projectiles</strong>, launching them at one another in <strong>stylish</strong> and <strong>spectacular</strong> combat. You're an unstoppable force of sword and fist, healing for every enemy defeated. Use everything at your disposal: dunk cars, explosives, anti-gravity-orbs, barrels, dumpsters, and many more ridiculous objects at your foes. Leave a trail of destruction and fractured asphalt as you carve a path through the hordes to silence <strong>five unique bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Camerata will increase their security with every boss that you and K8E silence, but it won't matter; together, <strong>you've got this</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/b72047dff38d3d6d09fe95cf53f16fb3.avif?t=1781737916\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras_big/b72047dff38d3d6d09fe95cf53f16fb3.avif?t=1781737916 width=800 height=135 /></span>Drive, drift, jump, and boost on a <strong>nimble and responsive</strong> physics-based <strong>motorcycle</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=247 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>stylized</strong>, <strong>vibrant</strong> <strong>regions</strong> and <strong>city districts</strong>. Discover new shortcuts and create new routes, alternating between K8E's gauntlet and bike form to chain together movement abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter packs of enemies on the road, and morph K8E into sword form; as the dust settles, morph her back into bike form and set off towards your next target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat with K8E</strong> in-between combat encounters. Get to know your mysterious vehicle-companion, and learn the circumstances of both her capture and betrayal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-tripping dunking system: launch cars, explosives, and dudes at other dudes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a friendship with K8E the talking, transforming motorcycle-gauntlet-sword</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive, fluid, physics-based motorcycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics for both K8E and the Rider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 80's synthwave retro-futuristic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic synthwave soundscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.webp?t=1781737916\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.poster.avif?t=1781737916\" class=\"bb_img\" width=778 height=233 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Meet K8E: a talking, transforming motorcycle-sword-gauntlet. Drive her to meet your enemies, and wield her to crater them into the asphalt. Turn the bodies of your enemies into supersonic projectiles in fast-paced, power-tripping combat. Don't let them take her voice.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/03578820ee57ad8b97e781322fb4b6cadf339e09/header.jpg?t=1781737916", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/206efe09fc02db86b94fd01836af5a91df325cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781737916", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/206efe09fc02db86b94fd01836af5a91df325cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781737916", "website": "https://impress.games/press-kit/virtual-unreality/sunset-suckerpunch", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> tbd</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> tbd</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Virtual Unreality Inc."], "publishers": ["Virtual Unreality Inc."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Cont